Source: lumo-base
Section: admin
Maintainer: Lumo Developers <developers@lumo.invalid>
Standards-Version: 4.7.4
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: lumo-base
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 base-files (= 13.8+deb13u6+lumo1),
 lumo-archive (>= 1.4)
Description: Lumo base system and hardware defaults
 This package depends on the Lumo-specific packages required by every
 Lumo installation: the system identity and the package archives
 that keep it updated.
 .
 It also provides optional hardware workarounds, including a NetworkManager
 power-saving example for the Realtek RTL8852CE wireless adapter. Examples
 are not automatically enabled.
 Removing it does not remove its dependencies, but may prevent future
 base-system additions from being installed automatically.
